eonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1070622-dark-eras-other-skills-options\"><b>Other Skills options</b></a> - Skills usage not covered in official materials - like Sailing</li> <li>[2E] <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1157475-dark-eras-how-to-run-war-machines\"><b>War Machines</b></a> - To use in your battles of previous Eras</li> <li><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1268561-dark-eras-dangers-of-land-travel\"><b>Dangers of land travel</b></a> - Before Steam Era, travel by land was very dangerous - here are ideas why - and what to throw at your players when they journey <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></li> <li><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1117619-dark-eras-early-middle-ages-resources\"><b>Early Middle Ages resources</b></a> - Things you may need to see or have to play in Eras like Wolf &amp; Raven</li> <li><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1046770-dark-eras-viking-era-travel-times\"><b>Pre-modern travel times</b></a> - Travel times of carts, boats and ships</li> <li>[2E] <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/975865-2e-researching-supernaturals-in-game\"><b>Researching supernaturals</b></a> - How to known what on Occult Skill dots known each character</li> </ul><b>Fan Eras:</b><ul><li><i><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1190729-dark-eras-american-revolution\"><b>American Revolution</b></a></i> - Start of Nameless Movement and modern countries</li> <li><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1135408-dark-eras-fan-to-the-strongest-%E2%80%93-arcadia-mountains-%E2%80%93-changeling-mage-werewolf-2e\"><i><b>Arcadia Mountains</b></i></a> - Fan supplement for Mage, Changeling and Werewolf set in one of most primeval regions of Greece - for To the Strongest.</li> <li><b><i><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1111302-dark-eras-baptism-of-poland-x-xi-century-poland\">Baptism of Poland</a> </i></b>- Clash of Christianity and pagan ways in 10<sup>th</sup> to 11<sup>th</sup> century Poland</li> <li><b><i><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1137216-dark-eras-fan-byzantine-empire\">Byzantine Empire</a></i></b> and Eastern Europe in Early Middle Ages ( 330\u20131453 A.D.)</li> <li><i><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1344875-dark-eras-fan-constantinople-%E2%80%93-early-medieval-istanbul-turkey-%E2%80%93-700-%E2%80%93-1000-ad\">Constantinople</a> </b></i>\u2013 Capitol of Eastern Roman Empire, called Byzantium, is cosmopolitan city that's monsters must fight with shadow of Contagion inside Plague of Justinian in years 700 \u2013 1000 AD.</li> <li><i><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1118077-dark-eras-crusades-thread\">Crusades</a></b></i> - Christians conquest of Holy Land in 11<sup>th</sup> to 13t<sup>h</sup> century</li> <li><i><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125616-fan-dark-era-conquest-of-paradise-age-of-exploration\">Conquer of Paradise</a> </b>\u2013 </i>Portugal and Spain and their conquests in 15<sup>th</sup> century</li> <li><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1271801-dark-eras-fan-kuaru-%E2%80%93-early-medieval-kiev-ukraine-%E2%80%93-circa-700-%E2%80%93-988-ad\"><i><b>Kuaru - Early Kiev</b></i></a> - Settlement that became <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kievan_Rus%27\" target=\"_blank\">Kievan Rus</a>, extension of <i>Wolf &amp; Raven</i> official Era</li> <li><i><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1320068-dark-eras-fan-odessos%E2%80%93-early-medieval-odessa-ukraine-%E2%80%93-circa-500-%E2%80%93-1055-ad\">Odessos \u2013 Early Medieval Odessa</a> </b></i>- Settlement of classical Greece, that later become one of jewels of Kievan Rus and Byzantine Empire boarders.</li> <li><b><i><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125181-dark-eras-medieval-ireland-750-850-ce\">Medieval Ireland</a> </i></b>\u2013 Perfect place for your Vikings raids</li> <li><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1373342-dark-eras-fan-satanic-panic-of-80s-90s\"><i><b>Satanic Panic </b></i></a>- of 1980s and 90s - For Beast, Mage and others</li> </ul><b>Fan materials to official Eras:</b><ul><li><b>[Sundered World] <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/916762-2e-dark-eras-fan-hollow-keepers\">Hollow Keepers Legacy</a> </b>- Moroi taking power from locking souls and traveling to Shadow Realm</li> <li><b>[Forsaken by Rome] <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1066944-dark-eras-forsaken-by-rome-%E2%80%93-roman-uratha\">Roman Uratha</a></b> - More info or ideas for playing werewolves in Rome</li> <li><b>[Wolf &amp; Raven] <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1046705-dark-eras-mother-wolf-for-norse-uratha\">Mother Wolf for Norse Uratha</a> </b>- How to reconcile Wolf, Moon, Odin and every other god in Norse Myths with <b>Werewolf </b>( and <b>CoD </b>) cosmology.</li> <li><b>[Wolf &amp; Raven] <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1106591-2e-dark-eras-wolf-raven-running-h%C3%B3lmganga-duels\">H\u00f3lmganga duels </a></b>- How to run honoral duels in Vikings society</li> <li><b>[Wolf &amp; Raven] <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1080508-2e-fan-dark-eras-wolf-and-raven-lodge-of-moon-hounds\">Lodge of Moon Hounds</a></b> - Pure Lodge coming from Norse myths, hunting Auspices.</li> <li><b>[Wolf &amp; Raven] <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1047550-dark-eras-wolf-and-raven-nine-realms\">Nine Realms</a></b> - CoD cosmology associations with Norse mythology worlds.</li> </ul><b>Historical materials to gamelines:</b><ul><li><b>[Changeling] <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1163385-dark-eras-2e-core-council-of-elves-freeholds\">Council of Elves Freeholds</a></b></li> <li><b>[Mage] <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/387074-history-of-awakened-mage-timeline\">History of Awakened</a> </b>- (un)official Mage gameline Timeline from the start of humanity to modern days</li> <li><b>[Mage] <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1220967-dark-eras-how-orders-conquared-the-world\">How Orders Conquared the World?</a> </b>- Discussion about how Diamond Orders spread around the Fallen World before their world hegemony.</li> <li><b>[Mage] <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1191215-nameless-war-%E2%80%93-fan-approach\">Nameless War</a> </b>- Fan approach on the most important conflict in modern Orders 